{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel blown, stuck outside Springdale. You don't make it into town, but town still makes its way to you, so put on the kettle and pour for those who show up. Even the ones who can't quite reach your window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/4322af26a7f1045d35c6ee2dc0f9ca9f.poster.avif?t=1761774457\" width=1170 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/4322af26a7f1045d35c6ee2dc0f9ca9f.webm?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/4322af26a7f1045d35c6ee2dc0f9ca9f.mp4?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You: Tea might be too strong.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Molly: But I earned it! I've been so hayve.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You: Brave?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Molly: No, <strong>hayve</strong>. Like when Miss Marisol yells at me to stop running around her store.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Molly: \u201cMolly, beHAVE!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Molly: Well, I AM being hayve. Super hayve.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branching Storylines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stopover becomes a season, then another as strangers become regulars. Stories branch on small decisions. Decide how to stand by your childhood friend when the past shows up at his door. What do you tell a kid trying to make her mom smile again? How do you approach the monster in the deep forest? And sure, help Milo overthink a drink for his crush. Maybe Earl Grey with rose petals?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/bafa690870fe3b60496586052aea5bdf.poster.avif?t=1761774457\" width=1170 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/bafa690870fe3b60496586052aea5bdf.webm?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/bafa690870fe3b60496586052aea5bdf.mp4?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactile Tea-making</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop, steep, pour. Drinks won\u2019t alter major story paths, but do flavor the moment. A good pour gets a smile; a scorched mess gets roasted; then the conversation carries on. Bad brews welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/7f7e5d16256776b548aff40262cbe9a6.poster.avif?t=1761774457\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/7f7e5d16256776b548aff40262cbe9a6.webm?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/7f7e5d16256776b548aff40262cbe9a6.mp4?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Calming Rituals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle into the simple rhythm of a tea-maker. Arrange jars, sweep stray leaves. The cart's small rituals ground you when conversations get heavy and nights get cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/6652afa327a6b8320d718920609be177.poster.avif?t=1761774457\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/6652afa327a6b8320d718920609be177.webm?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/6652afa327a6b8320d718920609be177.mp4?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Humor Meets Heartbreak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life here can be funny and aching in the same breath. When you can\u2019t fix what\u2019s broken, just be there. Share tea. Listen. Sometimes that\u2019s enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/f0916c70b889bf23834791d784f09646.poster.avif?t=1761774457\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/f0916c70b889bf23834791d784f09646.webm?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/extras/f0916c70b889bf23834791d784f09646.mp4?t=1761774457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3904480?t=1761774457","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/4dfc271c01819ae50adf637e7f75772f18486ef4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761774457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/3f5764339083bf2e465581c9636753972c8b9d8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761774457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3904480/3f5764339083bf2e465581c9636753972c8b9d8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761774457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"d